        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stephen Kaplan, Richard Fleischer, David Ambrose, William Wales\n- Products: Amityville 3-D\n- Topics: The Amityville Horror, hoax claims\n\nFacts:\n- Stephen Kaplan wrote an overview of The Amityville Horror.\n- Stephen Kaplan's overview of The Amityville Horror became the basis for the film Amityville 3-D.\n- Amityville 3-D chronicles Stephen Kaplan's attempt to prove that the Amityville story was a hoax.\n- Richard Fleischer directed Amityville 3-D.\n- David Ambrose wrote the script for Amityville 3-D under the pseudonym William Wales.",
